        "description": "Mandatory project-agnostic spine: decompose all collaborative work into\nindependently verifiable chunks across intent→design→implement→integrate→operate.\nRigid stages and hard gates; preferences (lint, test runner, style) live in\ncustomization only. Chat claims of done without evidence are violations.\n",
        "enforcement_level": "blocking",
        "rules": [
          {
            "description": "One chunk equals one independently verifiable claim; no deferred proof across stages.",
            "id": "VDS-R1"
          },
          {
            "description": "Narrative is never evidence; evidence_refs must be re-runnable footprints.",
