      "instructions": "Process audit protocol for PER-MMORCH-PROCESS-AUDITOR:\n1. Observe: whats-next, active CVS, ATK velocity, backlog age, CAP last cycle, mesh claims.\n2. Hypothesize: map gaps to F-001..F-007 style findings.\n3. Test: smallest CLI evidence probes.\n4. Verify: objectify findings via goal/req/pri/bli cascade; never hand-edit docs/process.\n",
      "instructions_summary": "Standardized MMORCH process audit: observe metrics, hypothesize gaps, test smallest probe, verify persistence of findings as kernel objects.",
